  "interpretation": {
    "h2": "Positive, difficulty-adjusted predictive association in learned selector exchanges across the same development panel; robust to image fixed effects and all fixed seeds, with modest positive held-image prediction gains. This is not a causal angle intervention, final-test confirmation, or evidence that conditioning beats a strong shared selector.",
